@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 09. Host Agent Security Model

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Input Guard" {
  [HostA2AController] as HostA2AController
  [PromptInjectionGuard] as PromptGuard
}

rectangle "Routing & Invocation Guard" {
  [A2AClientRegistry] as Registry
  [Endpoint Allowlist] as Allowlist
  [A2AInvocationService] as Invoker
  [Timeout/Retry Policy] as TimeoutRetry
  [Circuit Breaker] as CircuitBreaker
  [Payload Size Guard] as PayloadGuard
}

rectangle "Error Safety" {
  [GlobalExceptionHandler] as ErrorHandler
}

HostA2AController --> PromptGuard : sanitize user text
Invoker --> Registry : resolve target
Registry --> Allowlist : validate agent key/endpoint
Invoker --> TimeoutRetry : bounded call
Invoker --> CircuitBreaker : fail-fast on repeated errors
Invoker --> PayloadGuard : truncate/validate payload
ErrorHandler --> Invoker : sanitize exception mapping

note right of Allowlist
Host agent can call only
- product A2A endpoint
- reservation A2A endpoint
- search A2A endpoint
end note

note bottom of ErrorHandler
No sensitive leak
- internal stack
- downstream raw headers/body
- credentials
end note

@enduml
